    "_summary": "Shows how to use DataTables.",
    "_description": "# DataTables\n\n[Data Tables](https://hutonggames.com/playmaker/docs/components/data-table/) are a powerful new feature in PlayMaker 2.\n\nThese samples show some of the ways you can use DataTables.\n\n{height=300}![screenshot](Packages/com.hutonggames.playmaker/Editor/Addons/Packages/com.hutonggames.playmaker.samples.data-tables.jpg)\n\n## Features\n\n- Define custom data types using [Data Definitions](https://hutonggames.com/playmaker/docs/components/data-definition/)\n- Make [DataTable](https://hutonggames.com/playmaker/docs/components/data-table/) assets or components.\n- Use [Data Table Widgets](https://hutonggames.com/playmaker/docs/guides/ui-widgets/data/data-table-widget/) to draw tables in your game.\n- Use supporting components for [paging](https://hutonggames.com/playmaker/docs/guides/ui-widgets/data/data-paging/), [dragging](https://hutonggames.com/playmaker/docs/guides/ui-widgets/data/data-reorder-dragger/), [clicking](https://hutonggames.com/playmaker/docs/guides/ui-widgets/data/data-item-click-action/), etc.\n- Use DataTable actions to [add rows](action:DataTableAddRow), [sort](action:DataTableSort), [load](action:DataTableLoad), [save](action:DataTableSave), etc.\n",
